int(s), 6 track item(s), 1 zone(s)\\n./kicad/include/properties/property.h(607): assert \\\"m_choices.GetCount() > 0\\\" failed in PROPERTY_ENUM(): No enum choices defined\\n./kicad/include/properties/property.h(607): assert \\\"m_choices.GetCount() > 0\\\" failed in PROPERTY_ENUM(): No enum choices defined\\n./kicad/include/properties/property.h(607): assert \\\"m_choices.GetCount() > 0\\\" failed in PROPERTY_ENUM(): No enum choices defined\\n\",\n    \"warning_assessment\": \"Three PROPERTY_ENUM assertion diagnostics coexist with populated geometry output. Native pad/net counts agree with separately parsed board; these diagnostics do not establish a circuit defect. Geometry is not a transient measurement.\"\n  },\n  \"scope\": \"All four supplied checks are static/native. None supplies ADC models, switching stimuli, or 1 ms electrical voltage measurements.\"\n}\n\nNote: No compatibility mode selected!\n\n\nCircuit: nominal native rc; deliberately unloaded, no adc emulation\n\nDoing analysis at TEMP = 27.000000 and TNOM = 27.000000\n\nUsing SPARSE 1.3 as Direct Linear Solver\n\nInitial Transient Solution\n--------------------------\n\nNode                                   Voltage\n----                                   -------\nin                                           0\nout                                          0\nvstep#branch                                 0\n\n\nNo. of Data Rows : 20047\n\n  Measurements for Transient Analysis\n\nvout_initial        =  0.000000e+00\nvin_at_1ms          =  1.000000e+00\nvout_at_1ms         =  6.321206e-01\n\n\nTotal analysis time (seconds) = 0.026\n\nTotal elapsed time (seconds) = 0.027 \n\nTotal DRAM available = 128728.297 MB.\nDRAM currently available = 8964.137 MB.\nMaximum ngspice program size =   21.816 MB.\nCurrent ngspice program size =   13.227 MB.\n\nShared ngspice pages =   10.801 MB.\nText (code) pages =    6.156 MB.\nStack = 0 bytes.\nLibrary pages =    2.566 MB.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
